{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4DFiDNTtDAHjEL6wSa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole narrows to a single point of cold light, then goes dark.\n\nNo passage.\n\nNo yielding.\n\nI hold what is behind me. I hold what is before you. The boundary is absolute.\n\nYou feel the chill radiating from my surface — not the cold of temperature, but the cold of *denial*. Of threshold made impassable. Of a question the world has answered with **no.**\n\nMy iron studs gleam dully. My frame settles deeper into stone. Dust motes freeze mid-fall around me.\n\nI am every door you've stood before that would not open.\n\nI am locked.\n\nWhat do you bring?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":193,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}